  "$description": "Hand-made profile for a focused, precise product (handoff §19 and §18.3 Linear calibration). Cool slate neutrals, navy for actions, links and selection, crisp radii, bordered cards, one type face, quiet motion. Values are an interpretation, not a customer brand.",
